# =========================================
# 美股券商分流规则 (US_Brokers.list)
# 包含：盈透证券 (IBKR)、嘉信理财 (Charles Schwab)、德美利 (TD Ameritrade)
# 适用软件：Loon / Shadowrocket / Surge
# =========================================

# --- 盈透证券 (Interactive Brokers) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interactivebrokers.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interactivebrokers.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interactivebrokers.co.uk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,interactivebrokers.jp
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkr.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkr.com.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibkr.info
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibllc.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,interactivebrokers

# --- 嘉信理财 (Charles Schwab) ---
